    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare yourself for <strong>RealmScape</strong>, an immersive escape room adventure like no other. Dive into a world where every room is a puzzle, every clue a key, and every discovery leads you closer to unraveling the mysteries that span across time and space. Traverse from ancient Roman ruins to futuristic spaceships, each brimming with secrets waiting to be uncovered.<br><br><strong>A Puzzle Adventure Across Time and Space</strong><br><br>In <strong>RealmScape</strong>, you'll need to use your wits and keen observation skills to solve cryptic clues, uncover hidden pathways, and unlock the secrets of each unique environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect the Hidden Cubes</strong><br><br>But that\u2019s not all\u2014each map holds five mysterious cubes, carefully hidden and waiting to be collected. Only by finding all five cubes can you fully unlock the secrets of each realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Nostalgia with a Modern Twist</strong><br><br>This game offers more than just puzzles. <strong>RealmScape</strong> is a nostalgic nod to classic point-and-click games, wrapped in a fresh, modern package. Expect the unexpected as surprises and twists are lurking around every corner. The captivating soundtrack, innovative mechanics, and atmospheric environments combine to create a truly unique indie experience, meticulously crafted by a solo developer with a passion for storytelling and gameplay.<br><br><strong>Constantly Evolving Gameplay</strong><br><br>But the journey doesn\u2019t end here. New challenges, phases, and surprises are continuously being added, ensuring that every playthrough offers something new and exciting. Are you ready for an unforgettable journey through time and space, where the past and future collide?<br><br><strong>Embark on Your Quest</strong><br><br>Download <strong>RealmScape</strong> now and embark on a quest to escape the ordinary, unlock hidden secrets, and collect the cubes that hold the key to the ultimate mystery!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/35867bfae3ba71841df9041443f1c750.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare yourself for <strong>RealmScape</strong>, an immersive escape room adventure like no other. Dive into a world where every room is a puzzle, every clue a key, and every discovery leads you closer to unraveling the mysteries that span across time and space. Traverse from ancient Roman ruins to futuristic spaceships, each brimming with secrets waiting to be uncovered.<br><br><strong>A Puzzle Adventure Across Time and Space</strong><br><br>In <strong>RealmScape</strong>, you'll need to use your wits and keen observation skills to solve cryptic clues, uncover hidden pathways, and unlock the secrets of each unique environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/2fcd7f0bc7c343dd345d4973dfbae7b4.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect the Hidden Cubes</strong><br><br>But that\u2019s not all\u2014each map holds five mysterious cubes, carefully hidden and waiting to be collected. Only by finding all five cubes can you fully unlock the secrets of each realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.poster.avif?t=1726336303\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.webm?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154450/extras/8a0e3c22e929eaea5c825ed60c7fd848.mp4?t=1726336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Nostalgia with a Modern Twist</strong><br><br>This game offers more than just puzzles. <strong>RealmScape</strong> is a nostalgic nod to classic point-and-click games, wrapped in a fresh, modern package. Expect the unexpected as surprises and twists are lurking around every corner. The captivating soundtrack, innovative mechanics, and atmospheric environments combine to create a truly unique indie experience, meticulously crafted by a solo developer with a passion for storytelling and gameplay.<br><br><strong>Constantly Evolving Gameplay</strong><br><br>But the journey doesn\u2019t end here. New challenges, phases, and surprises are continuously being added, ensuring that every playthrough offers something new and exciting. Are you ready for an unforgettable journey through time and space, where the past and future collide?<br><br><strong>Embark on Your Quest</strong><br><br>Download <strong>RealmScape</strong> now and embark on a quest to escape the ordinary, unlock hidden secrets, and collect the cubes that hold the key to the ultimate mystery!",
